        "sid": "JER 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto me, Though Moses and Samuel stood before me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my mind",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "could",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toward this people: cast",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "out of my sight, and let them go forth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass, if they say unto thee, Whither shall we go forth? then thou shalt tell them, Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Such as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for death, to death; and such as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the sword, to the sword; and such as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the famine, to the famine; and such as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the captivity, to the captivity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will appoint over them four kinds, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": the sword to slay, and the dogs to tear, and the fowls of the heaven, and the beasts of the earth, to devour and destroy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will cause them to be removed into all kingdoms of the earth, because of Manasseh the son of Hezekiah king of Judah, for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which he did in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For who shall have pity upon thee, O Jerusalem? or who shall bemoan thee? or who shall go aside to ask how thou doest?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast forsaken me, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", thou art gone backward: therefore will I stretch out my hand against thee, and destroy thee; I am weary with repenting.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will fan them with a fan in the gates of the land; I will bereave",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of children, I will destroy my people,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "since",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they return not from their ways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their widows are increased to me above the sand of the seas: I have brought upon them against the mother of the young men a spoiler at noonday: I have caused",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to fall upon it suddenly, and terrors upon the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She that hath borne seven languisheth: she hath given up the ghost; her sun is gone down while",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet day: she hath been ashamed and confounded: and the residue of them will I deliver to the sword before their enemies, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Woe is me, my mother, that thou hast borne me a man of strife and a man of contention to the whole earth! I have neither lent on usury, nor men have lent to me on usury;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "every one of them doth curse me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said, Verily it shall be well with thy remnant; verily I will cause the enemy to entreat thee",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "well",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the time of evil and in the time of affliction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall iron break the northern iron and the steel?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy substance and thy treasures will I give to the spoil without price, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for all thy sins, even in all thy borders.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
