          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", thou knowest: remember me, and visit me, and revenge me of my persecutors; take me not away in thy longsuffering: know that for thy sake I have suffered rebuke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy words were found, and I did eat them; and thy word was unto me the joy and rejoicing of mine heart: for I am called by thy name, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of hosts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I sat not in the assembly of the mockers, nor rejoiced; I sat alone because of thy hand: for thou hast filled me with indignation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why is my pain perpetual, and my wound incurable,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "refuseth to be healed? wilt thou be altogether unto me as a liar,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waters",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fail?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
