          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", If thou return, then will I bring thee again,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou shalt stand before me: and if thou take forth the precious from the vile, thou shalt be as my mouth: let them return unto thee; but return not thou unto them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will make thee unto this people a fenced brasen wall: and they shall fight against thee, but they shall not prevail against thee: for I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with thee to save thee and to deliver thee, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.15.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.15.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will deliver thee out of the hand of the wicked, and I will redeem thee out of the hand of the terrible.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
